      <h1>Amar Razzaq</h1>
      <p class="role">Associate Professor of Agricultural Economics<br>Business School, Huanggang Normal University, China</p>
      <p>I work on the economics of water, food systems and agricultural policy, mainly in Pakistan and China. Much of my research studies groundwater markets and irrigation, and how farmers, markets and institutions respond to environmental and economic change.</p>
      <p>I am also a consultant to the Asian Development Bank and write short policy commentaries on Pakistan's farm economy.</p>
      <p class="contact">
        <a href="mailto:amar.razzaq@hotmail.com">amar.razzaq@hotmail.com</a> ·
